<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Queensland Opals shares open steady.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Queensland Opals shares open steady.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in opal miner Queensland Opals NL made their debut on the Australian Stock Exchange at A$0.20 on Monday, steady with their issue price.</p>
<p>The company raised A$2.5 million from the initial public offering and said it would use the funds to start commercial production from 17 mining and exploration tenements in Queensland.</p>
<p>Initial work would be based on the conversion of two trial mining areas in the Canaway Range, located in the Eromanga region of the state's far west, into full mining operations.</p>
<p>-- Walter Watson 61-2 9373-1810</p>
</text>
